<title>JAPAN: Japan rubber stocks fall at end-Dec from Nov.</title>
<headline>Japan rubber stocks fall at end-Dec from Nov.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>End-December rubber stock figures, issued by the Japan Rubber Trade Association, with month-earlier and year-earlier comparisons, in tonnes, were as follows:</p>
<p>    Month	    Dec 96   Nov 96   Dec 95</p>
<p>    Stocks	   43,244   45,741   32,085</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks, in tonnes</p>
<p>    Crude rubber   37,366   39,698   25,920</p>
<p>    Synthetic	 5,761    5,932    6,087</p>
<p>    Latex		 117	111	 78</p>
</text>
